  Name: UCompass Bar
  Version: 1.1.8
  MinMFPSVersion: 1.8
  Instructions: "<b>Integration</b>\n\n\u2022 Go to (Toolbar)MFPS -> Addons -> CompassBar
    -> Setup Players\r\n\u2022 Then open a room/map scene (you have to do in each
    map scene) and then go to\r\n  MFPS -> Addons -> CompassBar -> Add Compass ->
    In the opened window select which compass style you want to integrate in this
    scene.\r\n\u2022 Ready!"
